<phrase>
  id: LANG_BRICK_HELP_GOAL
  desc: in Brick's help, the first paragraph: the aim of the game, and what the three numbers at the top of the screen mean
  user: extras
  <source>
    *: "Break all the bricks with the ball, and catch it with the paddle each time it comes down, or you lose a life. Clear the wall to go on to the next level. At the top are your lives beside a ball, your score in the middle and the level on the right."
  </source>
  <dest>
    *: "Trenqueu tots els maons amb la pilota i atrapeu-la amb la pala cada cop que baixi, o perdreu una vida. Buideu el mur per passar al nivell següent. A dalt hi ha les vides al costat d’una pilota, la puntuació al mig i el nivell a la dreta."
  </dest>
  <voice>
    *: ""
  </voice>
</phrase>
<phrase>
  id: LANG_BRICK_HELP_CONTROLS
  desc: in Brick's help, the iPod's buttons: keep ◀ and ▶ as they are, and Select and Menu as the iPod's own phrases name those buttons
  user: extras
  <source>
    *: "Turn the wheel, or hold ◀ or ▶, to move the paddle. Press Select to launch the ball, and to shoot once the paddle has guns. Press Menu to pause and see the menu."
  </source>
  <dest>
    *: "Gireu la roda, o manteniu premut ◀ o ▶, per moure la pala. Premeu Select per llançar la pilota, i per disparar quan la pala tingui canons. Premeu Menu per fer una pausa i veure el menú."
  </dest>
  <voice>
    *: ""
  </voice>
</phrase>
<phrase>
  id: LANG_BRICK_HELP_CATCH
  desc: in Brick's help, the good pieces that fall from broken bricks; keep the letters L, B, G, F, E and N as they are, they are drawn on the pieces
  user: extras
  <source>
    *: "Catch the falling letters for their powers: L gives you a life, B another ball, G makes the ball stick to the paddle, F gives the paddle guns, E makes it longer, and N brings it back to normal."
  </source>
  <dest>
    *: "Atrapeu les lletres que cauen per obtenir-ne els poders: L us dona una vida, B una altra pilota, G fa que la pilota s’enganxi a la pala, F dona canons a la pala, E l’allarga i N la torna a la normalitat."
  </dest>
  <voice>
    *: ""
  </voice>
</phrase>
<phrase>
  id: LANG_BRICK_HELP_AVOID
  desc: in Brick's help, the bad pieces that fall from broken bricks; keep the letters D, S and FL and the signs ◀ and ▶ as they are, they are drawn on the pieces or are the iPod's buttons
  user: extras
