<phrase>
  id: LANG_JEWELS_HELP_GOAL
  desc: in Jewels' help, the first paragraph: how the game is played in Normal mode
  user: extras
  <source>
    *: "Swap two jewels side by side so that three or more of a kind line up, and they vanish. Each match fills the bar on the right, and a full bar takes you to the next level. The game ends when no swap can make a match."
  </source>
  <dest>
    *: "Intercanvieu dues joies del costat perquè se n’alineïn tres o més d’iguals, i desapareixeran. Cada combinació omple la barra de la dreta, i amb la barra plena passeu al nivell següent. La partida s’acaba quan cap intercanvi no pot fer una combinació."
  </dest>
  <voice>
    *: ""
  </voice>
</phrase>
<phrase>
  id: LANG_JEWELS_HELP_PUZZLE
  desc: in Jewels' help, the second paragraph: the aim of the Puzzle mode; Puzzle is the mode's name in the menu, as LANG_JEWELS_PUZZLE
  user: extras
  <source>
    *: "In Puzzle, each of the ten boards has a few pieces with links. Swap and clear the jewels around them until every link meets the link of another piece."
  </source>
  <dest>
    *: "A Trencaclosques, cadascun dels deu taulers té unes quantes peces amb enllaços. Intercanvieu i elimineu les joies del voltant fins que cada enllaç toqui l’enllaç d’una altra peça."
  </dest>
  <voice>
    *: ""
  </voice>
</phrase>
<phrase>
  id: LANG_JEWELS_HELP_CONTROLS
  desc: in Jewels' help, the iPod's buttons: keep ◀ and ▶ as they are, and Menu, Play and Select as the iPod's own phrases name those buttons
  user: extras
  <source>
    *: "Turn the wheel to move through the board, or press ◀, ▶, Menu and Play to move left, right, up and down. Press Select on a jewel, then ◀, ▶, Menu or Play to swap it with its neighbour that way. Hold Select for the menu."
  </source>
  <dest>
    *: "Gireu la roda per recórrer el tauler, o premeu ◀, ▶, Menu i Play per moure-us a l’esquerra, a la dreta, amunt i avall. Premeu Select sobre una joia i després ◀, ▶, Menu o Play per intercanviar-la amb la veïna d’aquella banda. Manteniu premut Select per veure el menú."
  </dest>
  <voice>
    *: ""
  </voice>
</phrase>
