<phrase>
  id: LANG_SOLITAIRE_HELP_AIM
  desc: in Solitaire's Help, the first paragraph: the aim and the rules. Menu is the iPod's Menu button, named as the iPod's manual in your language names it
  user: extras
  <source>
    *: "Move all the cards onto the four piles at the top right, each by suit from ace to king. In the seven columns, put each card on one a rank higher and of the other colour; only a king goes into an empty column. Menu turns over cards from the deck at the top left, one or three at a time as set in Draw Cards."
  </source>
  <dest>
    *: "Porteu totes les cartes a les quatre piles de dalt a la dreta, una per pal, de l’as al rei. A les set columnes, poseu cada carta sobre una altra que valgui just un més i sigui de l’altre color; només un rei pot anar a una columna buida. Menu gira cartes del munt de dalt a l’esquerra, d’una en una o de tres en tres, segons «Robar cartes»."
  </dest>
  <voice>
    *: ""
  </voice>
</phrase>
<phrase>
  id: LANG_SOLITAIRE_HELP_MOVE
  desc: in Solitaire's Help, the second paragraph: moving the cursor. ◀ and ▶ are the iPod's Previous and Next buttons, kept as these signs; the wheel is the click wheel
  user: extras
  <source>
    *: "◀ and ▶ move between the columns; past the first or the last one, they go to the turned card beside the deck. The wheel moves up and down a column, and along the top row between the turned card and the four piles."
  </source>
  <dest>
    *: "◀ i ▶ passen d’una columna a una altra; més enllà de la primera o de l’última, van a la carta girada del costat del munt. La roda puja i baixa per una columna, i recorre la fila de dalt entre la carta girada i les quatre piles."
  </dest>
  <voice>
    *: ""
  </voice>
</phrase>
<phrase>
  id: LANG_SOLITAIRE_HELP_SELECT
  desc: in Solitaire's Help, the third paragraph: moving cards. Select and Menu are the iPod's buttons of those names, as the iPod's manual in your language names them
  user: extras
  <source>
    *: "Select picks up the card under the cursor. Select on another column or pile moves it there with the cards on it, or puts it back if it can't go there. Select on the same card again sends it to its pile if it fits. Menu also puts back a card picked up."
  </source>
  <dest>
    *: "Select agafa la carta que hi ha sota el cursor. Select sobre una altra columna o pila l’hi mou amb les cartes que té a sobre, o la torna al seu lloc si no hi pot anar. Select un altre cop sobre la mateixa carta l’envia a la seva pila si hi encaixa. Menu també torna al seu lloc una carta agafada."
  </dest>
  <voice>
    *: ""
  </voice>
</phrase>
<phrase>
